{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "金库通胀",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 110.62,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "方向都写对了，金库就安全了吗？不一定。",
   "spoken": "方向都写对了，金库就安全了吗？不一定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.108
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "ERC-4626 的份额公式是：存入资产，乘以总份额，除以总资产。",
   "spoken": "ERC-4626 的份额公式是：存入资产，乘以总份额，除以总资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 5.58,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 5.58,
   "speechEnd": 12.799
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "结果向下取整。这一步方向没错。",
   "spoken": "结果向下取整。这一步方向没错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 13.24,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 13.24,
   "speechEnd": 16.202
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "麻烦在总资产。它通常直接读金库的代币余额。",
   "spoken": "麻烦在总资产。它通常直接读金库的代币余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 16.66,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 16.759,
   "speechEnd": 20.977
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "而余额，任何人都能通过直接转账来增加。",
   "spoken": "而余额，任何人都能通过直接转账来增加。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 21.36,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 21.36,
   "speechEnd": 25.018
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "看攻击怎么走。金库是空的。",
   "spoken": "看攻击怎么走。金库是空的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 25.42,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 25.516,
   "speechEnd": 27.852
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "第一步，攻击者存入 1 wei，拿到 1 份额。",
   "spoken": "第一步，攻击者存入 1 wei，拿到 1 份额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 28.28,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 28.379,
   "speechEnd": 31.352
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "第二步，攻击者不走存款函数，直接往金库转入 1 万 USDC。",
   "spoken": "第二步，攻击者不走存款函数，直接往金库转入 1 万 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 31.78,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 31.874,
   "speechEnd": 37.084
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "现在总份额只有 1，总资产是 1 万 USDC，再加 1 个最小单位。",
   "spoken": "现在总份额只有 1，总资产是 1 万 USDC，再加 1 个最小单位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 37.52,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 37.61,
   "speechEnd": 43.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "第三步，受害者存入 9999 USDC。",
   "spoken": "第三步，受害者存入 9999 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 44.06,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 44.06,
   "speechEnd": 47.992
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "他的份额，是 9999 USDC 乘以 1，除以略多于 1 万 USDC。",
   "spoken": "他的份额，是 9999 USDC 乘以 1，除以略多于 1 万 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 48.44,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 48.533,
   "speechEnd": 55.941
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "结果小于 1，向下取整，是 0。",
   "spoken": "结果小于 1，向下取整，是 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 56.42,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 56.42,
   "speechEnd": 59.422
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "受害者的资产进了金库，却一份也没拿到。",
   "spoken": "受害者的资产进了金库，却一份也没拿到。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 59.84,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 59.84,
   "speechEnd": 63.813
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "第四步，攻击者赎回那 1 份额，取回约 19999 USDC。",
   "spoken": "第四步，攻击者赎回那 1 份额，取回约 19999 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 64.22,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 64.32,
   "speechEnd": 70.026
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "这 1 份额，代表了金库的全部资产。受害者的存款，等于捐给了它。",
   "spoken": "这 1 份额，代表了金库的全部资产。受害者的存款，等于捐给了它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 70.44,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 70.44,
   "speechEnd": 76.39
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "攻击者通常会抢跑受害者的第一笔存款交易。",
   "spoken": "攻击者通常会抢跑受害者的第一笔存款交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 76.82,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 76.915,
   "speechEnd": 80.27
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "攻击成本，就是捐赠额。受害者的存款接近捐赠额，攻击就有利可图。",
   "spoken": "攻击成本，就是捐赠额。受害者的存款接近捐赠额，攻击就有利可图。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 80.72,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 80.817,
   "speechEnd": 86.591
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "成立条件也要说清：金库必须几乎是空的。",
   "spoken": "成立条件也要说清：金库必须几乎是空的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 87.02,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 87.02,
   "speechEnd": 90.753
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "金库规模越大，攻击成本越高。",
   "spoken": "金库规模越大，攻击成本越高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 91.16,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 91.256,
   "speechEnd": 93.558
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "换成披萨店：第一个顾客买下整张披萨，只切成 1 块。",
   "spoken": "换成披萨店：第一个顾客买下整张披萨，只切成 1 块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 93.94,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 93.94,
   "speechEnd": 98.246
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "然后往盒子里偷偷塞进 100 张披萨。",
   "spoken": "然后往盒子里偷偷塞进 100 张披萨。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-20.wav",
   "start": 98.64,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 98.733,
   "speechEnd": 102.129
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "下一个顾客付了 99 张的钱，因为 1 块披萨值 101 张，他一块也分不到。",
   "spoken": "下一个顾客付了 99 张的钱，因为 1 块披萨值 101 张，他一块也分不到。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg4-21.wav",
   "start": 102.54,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 102.54,
   "speechEnd": 109.222
  }
